@startuml
 title Bus and route assignment
autonumber
actor Administrator as Admin
participant "application web" as app
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "route-service" as RTE
queue Kafka
participant "gps-service" as GPS
participant "bus-service" as bus

Admin -> app: assigns bus a route
app -> GW: request of assignment
GW -> RTE: create RouteBusAssignment
RTE -> RTE: validates uniqueness of assignment
RTE -> Kafka: publishes bus assigned a route
Kafka -> GPS: delivery evento
GPS -> bus: queries device GPS of the bus
bus --> GPS: device associated
GPS -> GPS: Asocia tracking a route
GPS --> RTE: confirms assignment
RTE --> app: assignment completada
app --> Admin: confirmation
@enduml

